 name=\"ITC.apps.tf.labels.internalTesters\",\r\n        is_default_external_group=false,\r\n        is_internal_group=true,\r\n        provider_id=369xxx,\r\n        is_active=true,\r\n        created=\"2017-05-28T02:05:28.266+0000\",\r\n        app_id=11xxxxxxxx>, <Spaceship::TestFlight::Group\r\n        id=\"b413ffa1-77cd-47d2-9413-2bc1ccexxxxx\",\r\n        name=\"ITC.apps.tf.labels.CustomGroup1\",\r\n        is_default_external_group=true,\r\n        is_internal_group=false,\r\n        provider_id=369783,\r\n        is_active=true,\r\n        created=\"2017-05-28T02:05:28.273+0000\",\r\n        app_id=11xxxxxxxx>]\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut when we do this again with a new app_identifier:\r\n\r\n- `app = Spaceship::Tunes::Application.find(app_identifier2)`\r\n- `external_group = Spaceship::TestFlight::Group.all(app_id: app.apple_id)`\r\n\r\n*We get the exact same result.*\r\n\r\nLooking at the source code for [test_flight/client.rb](https://github.com/fastlane/fastlane/blob/master/spaceship/lib/spaceship/test_flight/client.rb#L95), I can see that the function `get_groups(app_id: nil)` for getting groups does the following`return @cached_groups if @cached_groups`. And I cannot see any way to reset the cache. \r\n\r\nHow can I get around this or reset the cache so I can get groups for more than one app in a Test Flight session?\r\n\r\n##### Complete output when running fastlane, including the stack trace and command used\r\n<!-- You can use: `--capture_output` as the last commandline argument to get that collected for you -->\r\n\r\n<!-- The output of `--capture_output` could contain sensitive data such as application ids, certificate ids, or email addreses, Please make sure you double check the output and replace anything sensitive you don't wish to submit in the issue -->\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <pre>[INSERT OUTPUT HERE]</pre>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### Environment\r\n\r\n<!-- Please run `fastlane env` and copy the output below. This will help us help you :+1:\r\nIf you used `--capture_output` option, please remove this block as it is already included there. -->\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <pre>Too much sensitive data to share... </pre>\r\n</details>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"fastlane-bot","id":17056452,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDU2NDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17056452?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/fastlane-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fastlane-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastlane/fastlane/issues/11905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastlane/fastlane/issues/11905/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}